<!--
  RELEASE AdMob ids. This file overrides the ids in main/ for the release
  build ONLY (debug always keeps the test ids in main/res/values/ads.xml).

  RIGHT NOW these are still Google's TEST ids on purpose, so this build earns
  nothing and is safe to install and tap. Valid ids are required here either
  way: the AdMob SDK validates the App ID at process start and a bogus value
  crashes the app on launch.

  TO GO LIVE for SG 4D:
    1. Register the app at https://apps.admob.com under the package name
       com.imagoforge.sg4d, then create a banner, an interstitial and a rewarded unit.
    2. Replace ALL FOUR ids below with your own:
         - app_id          : App settings > App ID       (uses '~')
         - banner_id       : Ad units > banner unit      (uses '/')
         - interstitial_id : Ad units > interstitial     (uses '/')
         - rewarded_id     : Ad units > rewarded         (uses '/')
    3. In the Play Console, declare that the app contains ads and declare the
       advertising ID. Ship a privacy policy URL. Both are mandatory.

  Never tap your own live ads; only this signed release build carries them.
-->
<resources>
    <string name="admob_app_id" translatable="false">ca-app-pub-3940256099942544~3347511713</string>
    <string name="admob_banner_id" translatable="false">ca-app-pub-3940256099942544/6300978111</string>
    <string name="admob_interstitial_id" translatable="false">ca-app-pub-3940256099942544/1033173712</string>
    <string name="admob_rewarded_id" translatable="false">ca-app-pub-3940256099942544/5224354917</string>
